WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
1. Assign stable groups
Assign users to A or B. The example uses equal groups, but the split can be different.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
2. Group A gets experience A
Users assigned to A keep seeing variant A. Record the outcome you chose before the experiment.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
3. Group B gets experience B
Users assigned to B keep seeing variant B. Measure the same outcome for a fair comparison.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
4. Compare the outcomes
Compare the groups with an appropriate analysis. This diagram does not assume that either variant wins.
